{
    "title": "GitHub Copilot AI Adoption Cohort \u2014 User Attribution & Token Budget",
    "uid": "copilot-cohort-user-attribution",
    "tags": [
      "copilot",
      "cohorts",
      "ai-adoption",
      "token-budget",
      "per-user"
    ],
    "timezone": "browser",
    "schemaVersion": 39,
    "version": 1,
    "style": "dark",
    "editable": true,
    "time": {
      "from": "now-60d",
      "to": "now"
    },
    "templating": {
      "list": [
        {
          "current": {},
          "hide": 0,
          "includeAll": false,
          "label": "Data source",
          "multi": false,
          "name": "datasource",
          "options": [],
          "query": "prometheus",
          "queryValue": "",
          "refresh": 1,
          "regex": "",
          "type": "datasource"
        },
        {
          "current": {
            "text": "sherwin-williams",
            "value": "sherwin-williams"
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "${datasource}",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "definition": "label_values(github_copilot_user_ai_adoption_phase, enterprise)",
          "hide": 0,
          "includeAll": false,
          "label": "Enterprise",
          "multi": false,
          "name": "enterprise",
          "query": {
            "query": "label_values(github_copilot_user_ai_adoption_phase, enterprise)",
            "refId": "StandardVariableQuery"
          },
          "refresh": 2,
          "regex": "",
          "type": "query"
        },
        {
          "current": {
            "text": "All",
            "value": "$__all"
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "${datasource}",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "definition": "label_values(github_copilot_user_ai_adoption_phase{enterprise=\"$enterprise\"}, ai_adoption_phase)",
          "hide": 0,
          "includeAll": true,
          "allValue": ".*",
          "label": "AI Adoption Phase",
          "multi": true,
          "name": "phase",
          "query": {
            "query": "label_values(github_copilot_user_ai_adoption_phase{enterprise=\"$enterprise\"}, ai_adoption_phase)",
            "refId": "StandardVariableQuery"
          },
          "refresh": 2,
          "regex": "",
          "type": "query"
        }
      ]
    },
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 800,
        "title": "How to read this dashboard",
        "type": "text",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 5,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "targets": [],
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "## AI Adoption Cohort \u2192 User Attribution & Token Budget\n\nGitHub classifies every active Copilot user into an **AI Adoption Phase** daily, based on which Copilot surfaces they used in the preceding 28-day window.\n\n| Phase | Name | Criteria | Suggested Monthly Token Budget |\n|:---:|---|---|---|\n| 0 | No Cohort | Did not meet engagement criteria for any phase | 50,000 |\n| 1 | Code First | Used code completion and/or IDE agent mode | 150,000 |\n| 2 | Agent First | Used one GitHub-based agent surface (cloud agent / code review / CLI) | 400,000 |\n| 3 | Multi-Agent | Used two or more GitHub-based agent surfaces | 1,000,000 |\n\n**Source metric:** `github_copilot_user_ai_adoption_phase{user_login, user_id, ai_adoption_phase}` written daily per user. Use the **Phase** filter above to focus on a specific cohort. Token budget multipliers in the bottom table can be changed directly in the panel query."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 801,
        "title": "Phase 0 \u2014 No Cohort",
        "type": "stat",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 5
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "description": "Number of distinct users currently assigned to Phase 0 \u2014 No Cohort.",
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "fixedColor": "gray",
              "mode": "fixed"
            },
            "unit": "none",
            "decimals": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "gray",
                  "value": null
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "count(last_over_time(github_copilot_user_ai_adoption_phase{enterprise=\"$enterprise\",ai_adoption_phase=\"phase_0\"}[1d]))",
            "instant": true,
            "refId": "A",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${datasource}"
            }
          }
        ],
        "options": {
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ]
          },
          "orientation": "auto",
          "textMode": "auto",
          "colorMode": "background"
        }
      },
